hat energy-application method we came up with last time,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":"bgm_story_languor","movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_projectmatis1_03_s_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen_young","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_projectmatis1_03_s_26","text":"I think we could actually pull it off.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_projectmatis1_03_s_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell_h","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_projectmatis1_03_s_27","text":"Well, well. Look at you.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_projectmatis1_03_s_28","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_projectmatis1_03_s_28","text":"Maxwell roughly tousles Syuen's hair.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_projectmatis1_03_s_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen_young","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_projectmatis1_03_s_29","text":"H-hey!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_projectmatis1_03_s_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell_h","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_projectmatis1_03_s_30","text":"Aren't you something?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_projectmatis1_03_s_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell_h","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_projectmatis1_03_s_31","text":"How do you come up with this stuff at your age?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_projectmatis1_03_s_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell_h","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_projectmatis1_03_s_32","text":"Is there really something special in your bloodline?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_projectmatis1_03_s_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen_young","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_projectmatis1_03_s_33","text":"What's a bloodline?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_projectmatis1_03_s_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell_h","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_projectmatis1_03_s_34","text":"I'm saying you're smart, just like your father.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_projectmatis1_03_s_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen_young","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_projectmatis1_03_s_35","text":"W-well, obviously! I am his daughter, after all.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_projectmatis1_03_s_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen_young","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_projectmatis1_03_s_36","text":"Anyway! Do you think this... is okay?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_projectmatis1_03_s_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell_h","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_projectmatis1_03_s_37","text":"Honestly... it's a pretty childish idea.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_projectmatis1_03_s_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen_young","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_projectmatis1_03_s_38","text":"What?!","jump":null,"